# CFS CMS - Cursor AI Instructions

**CFS CMS** is a Google Drive-like CMS built with SvelteKit + Cloudflare. See [AI-CONTEXT.md](AI-CONTEXT.md) for complete guide.

## Critical Patterns

### Three-Layer Architecture
```
UI Components → dataService → Svelte Stores → Mock Data (Phase 1) / API (Phase 2+)
```

**Key Rules**:
- Components: Import stores, use `$derived`, call dataService functions
- dataService.ts: ALL CRUD operations - only file that changes in Phase 2
- Mock data: ONLY imported by `src/lib/stores/index.ts`

### ✅ Use $derived for Reactive Lists
```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { workspaceFolders, currentWorkspace } from '$lib/stores';

	let rootFolders = $derived(
		$workspaceFolders.filter(
			(f) => f.parentId === null && f.workspaceId === $currentWorkspace?.id && !f.deletedAt
		)
	);
</script>
```

### ✅ Theme Colors Only
```svelte
<!-- ❌ WRONG: Raw Tailwind -->
<div class="bg-blue-500 text-gray-600">

<!-- ✅ CORRECT: Theme colors -->
<div class="bg-accent text-muted-foreground">
```

### ✅ lucide-svelte Icons Only
```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
<script>
	import { Folder } from 'lucide-svelte';
</script>

<!-- ❌ WRONG: Emojis -->
<div>📁 Folder</div>
```

## Essential Commands
```bash
npm run dev          # Dev server
npm run check        # TypeScript checking
npm run lint         # ESLint + Prettier
```

## Key Files
- **Business Logic**: `src/lib/services/dataService.ts`
- **State**: `src/lib/stores/index.ts`
- **Types**: `src/lib/types/index.ts`
- **Architecture**: [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)

## Common Pitfalls
❌ Don't import mock data in components  
❌ Don't use functions for reactive lists  
❌ Don't use raw Tailwind classes  
❌ Don't put business logic in components

**Phase 2**: Only dataService.ts changes. Components remain untouched.

See [AI-CONTEXT.md](AI-CONTEXT.md) for complete documentation.